<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33565" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Av.</u>
			244
		</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
			Dsc.
			4.52
		</span></i>): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλος</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of the marsh</i> or
			<i>meadow</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕ. ὕδωρ</span>
			<i>marsh</i>-water, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕ. δάπεδον</span> the surface
				<i>of the meads</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				352
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>growing</i> or <i>dwelling in the marsh</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόναξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					494
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν Αἰγυπτίων οἱ ἕ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.110
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος ἕ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				693a15
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷα] ἕ</span>. ib.<i><span class="en">
				674b31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχοῖνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτή</span> Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.173
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλειον, τό</span>, =
			<i>asparagus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλεία, ἡ</span>, title of Artemis in Cos, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Schwyzer</u>
				251
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				5
			</span></i>.</div>
